    <name>Gunung Wilis</name>
    <desc>Gunung Wilis: one-way trailhead -&gt; Gunung Wilis from the ORIGINAL recording (OpenStreetMap), no added geometry. no 'via' in name: kept the uploader's start -&gt; summit (4.47 km); dropped the rest (18.97 km: down another trail to 800 m, then back up the same way (median 2 m off) and down the way up). Evidence: kept part on OSM way 'Jalur Pendaki Gunung Wilis' (100%), relation 'Gunung Wilis' (100%); dropped part on OSM way 'Jalur Pendaki Gunung Wilis' (100%), relation 'Gunung Wilis' (100%). OSM data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.</desc>
